   "The Zimbabwe Economic Policy Analysis and Research Institute (ZEPARI) convened a Technical Validation Workshop at Monomotapa Hotel in Harare, bringing together key stakeholders to critically review research examining Zimbabwe's readiness to effectively participate in the African Continental Free Trade Area (AfCFTA).",
